; Regression test for issue #3278: a balance error from xact_base_t::verify()
; states the remainder at the precision the check used.
;
; The automated transaction adds a posting whose cost of 0.01 BAR leaves
; the extended transaction unbalanced.  BAR appears only in costs, so
; verify() widens it to the precision of the cost (see 1114.test), and
; reports that remainder; it used to restore the precision of 0 first,
; and so printed the remainder that failed the check as "0".

= /^Expenses:Food$/
    Expenses:Tips                    1 TIP @ 0.01 BAR

2024/01/01 Lunch
    Expenses:Food                     1 MEAL @ 12 BAR
    Assets:Cash                     -12 MEAL @ 1 BAR

test bal -> 1
__ERROR__
While parsing file "$FILE", line 15:
While balancing transaction from "$FILE", lines 13-15:
> 2024/01/01 Lunch
>     Expenses:Food                     1 MEAL @ 12 BAR
>     Assets:Cash                     -12 MEAL @ 1 BAR
Unbalanced remainder is:
             BAR0.01
Amount to balance against:
            BAR12.01
While applying automated transaction from "$FILE", lines 10-11:
> = /^Expenses:Food$/
>     Expenses:Tips                    1 TIP @ 0.01 BAR
While extending transaction from "$FILE", lines 13-15:
> 2024/01/01 Lunch
>     Expenses:Food                     1 MEAL @ 12 BAR
>     Assets:Cash                     -12 MEAL @ 1 BAR
Error: Transaction does not balance
end test
